{"ref":"BDB, אֲגַף","hw":"אֲגַף","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אֲגַף</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>band, army (</strong>loan-word, orig. <em>wing</em> of army; As. <em>agappu</em>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">אגף</span>, <em>wing</em>. Others, fr. <span dir=\"rtl\">גפף</span>, Sta<sup>§ 256 b</sup><strong>)</strong>—All Ez. & all pl. (or <em>du.</em>?) <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲגַפֶּיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.9\">Ez 38:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.4\">39:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲגַפָּיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.14\">12:14</a> + 3 textual; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲגַפֶּיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.6\">38:6</a> (all c. <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־</span> exc. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.22\">38:22</a>)—<em>bands, armies</em> of king of Judah <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 12:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.12.14\">Ez 12:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.21\">17:21</a>; <em>hordes</em> (RV) of Gog <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.9\">38:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:22\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.4\">39:4</a>; specif. of <span dir=\"rtl\">גֹּמֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 38:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.38.6\">38:6</a>; of <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹגַרְמָה</span> <em>ib.</em>","next":"BDB, אָגַר","prev":"BDB, אגף"}